{"about_the_game":"&quot;Bunny Space Odyssey: The Countdown&quot; is a hidden objects game: you need to find 100 eared helmets.<br>Explore the scientist's lab, find all the bunny helmets, and start delving into the story of the hopping pixel universe.<br>Just click on the helmet if you find it - and the countdown will begin! Make sure to catch everything! <br><br>&quot;Bunny Space Odyssey: The Countdown&quot; can be considered a prequel to the big story of the planet FlopHop, so you can also discover parts of the bunny world narration while searching for the helmets. <br>Click on those items where the cursor becomes a magnifying glass instead of a carrot - and you will learn more about the Bunny Space Odyssey world.<br>Will rabbits fly away from Earth, where life is becoming dangerous? Are you ready to embark on this mission?<br><br>Get achievements for finding helmets, reading lore, playing with the timer and setting new records! Is everybunn ready?<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954420/extras/join_our_discord.png?t=1726940583\" /><br>Find the link under the 'Basic Info' tab and join the AinkOink Discord Server!","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First helmet!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2954420/76d4483392702de25ab57711d01994d5eba30b0e.jpg"},{"name":"100!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2954420/25785d812b61082fd06dc5f71ecef0e1f1feef1a.jpg"},{"name":"Second!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2954420/f74ae9ec5558ff9f92851cab0a3f2a4668143e5f.jpg"},{"name":"Third!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2954420/339dd9fda47626b58658581878f1ce2e6f8c25eb.jpg"},{"name":"May the FOURTH be with you","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2954420/cc9ff7336a32b9bf73d63385b97ae54febd93420.